type: dataset
title: "Industrial crimping waveforms across five wire gauges with naturally occurring defects and signal drift"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Song
    given-names: Jinwoo
    affiliation: Dongguk University
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Heung Soo
    affiliation: Dongguk University
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - wire harness
  - crimping
  - manufacturing
  - quality monitoring
  - waveform drift
  - rare defects
abstract: "Six routine production sequences contain 9,829 crimping waveforms across five wire gauges, including 9,803 CFM-accepted and 26 CFM-rejected operations. Each waveform contains 200 ordered measurement points. Supporting code validates data integrity and generates descriptive figures. Python scripts are separately licensed under MIT."
